'''Space''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Space’s handle is black followed by a dark purple guard. The blade is purple, pink and blue, made to look like a galaxy. Stars are dotted all around the knife, including the handle.

== Trivia ==

*It has a partner gun under the name [[Nightfire]].
*This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.

